            "photo": "shopify://shop_images/rg-pdp-rev-kate.jpg",
            "title": "Just amazing",
            "text": "I was looking for something with less caffeine because regular coffee gave me energy spikes and made my hands shake, it was just too strong for me. This coffee was perfect instead. It's also really instant, it dissolves completely, with no clumps, unlike other 'instant' coffees I've tried. Now I can drink it a few times a day and feel fine, no shakes, no crash. Would definitely order it again.",
